=== Prompt ===
Who is Master Chief from Halo?

=== Response ===
Master Chief, also known as John-117, is a fictional character and the main protagonist of the Halo franchise created by Bungie and now managed by 343 Industries. He is a Spartan-II super soldier, genetically enhanced and augmented, and the central character of the Halo series, appearing in every game as the player character. Master Chief is known for his iconic green armor, his silent and stoic demeanor, and his unwavering dedication to his mission and comrades. He is often depicted as a symbol of resilience and heroism in the face of overwhelming odds. The Halo series is a popular science fiction franchise that includes video games, novels, and a live-action television series.

